Patient "1" -- "*" Case
Patient "1" -- "*" EpisodeOfCare
Patient "1" -- "*" Consent

Case "0..1" -- "1" EpisodeOfCare
Case "1" -- "*" FormResponse
Case "1" -- "*" JournalDraft
Case "1" *-- "*" ColleagueReview
Case "*" -- "*" CareTeam : TEAM assignment
Case "*" -- "*" User : NAMED assignment
EpisodeOfCare "1" *-- "0..1" Referral

CareTeam "*" -- "*" User : members
ColleagueReview "*" -- "1" User : reviewer

EpisodeOfCare "1" -- "*" PatientJourney
PatientJourney "1" -- "*" Instruction

PatientJourney "*" -- "1" JourneyTemplate
FormResponse "*" -- "0..1" PatientJourney

JourneyTemplate "1" -- "*" JourneyTemplateEntry
JourneyTemplate "1" -- "*" JourneyTemplateInstruction
JourneyTemplateInstruction "*" -- "1" InstructionTemplate
JourneyTemplateEntry "*" -- "0..1" QuestionnaireTemplate
FormResponse "*" -- "1" QuestionnaireTemplate

Consent "*" -- "1" ResearchModule

note right of Patient
  Simplified overview.
  Referral and ColleagueReview are nested
  objects, not top-level AppState collections.
